# (build 165) The attract crawl in Japanese: two rows a line, the marks
# above each (the stock crawl's lines are a row apart), his `jp` of the
# second message: やみのちからによって アルゴルをしはいしていた ...
start new
language ja
wait screen level
wait script $1402
wait ticks 30
expect pixel 172 150 $EEE      # the dakuten over ゴ, the row above the line
shot 01_second
